# Public Supabase settings used by production and preview builds (vite build).
#
# These values are PUBLIC by design: they are compiled into the JavaScript
# that every visitor downloads. Data is protected by Row Level Security in
# the database, not by keeping this key hidden. Never put a secret or
# service_role key in any VITE_ variable or in this file.
#
# Variables set in Vercel (Settings -> Environment Variables) take priority
# over this file, so a staging preview can point elsewhere by setting them.
